Description: Convert, compress and resize images
 Redux converts batches of images to WebP, JPEG or PNG and makes them
 lighter: adjust the quality or compression, resize them, rename them with
 a pattern and remove their metadata. When it finishes, a report shows how
 much space you saved. Your original images are never modified.
